invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: a KeyUpdate whose body is not one byte is refused with
  unexpected_message again, where RFC 9846 section 6 requires decode_error
  for a message that does not parse (rfc9846.txt:3785-3788).
  bin/unit requires decode_error for bodies of 0 and 2 bytes.

--- old
    if (msg_len != 1) {
        *alert = ALERT_DECODE_ERROR;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    if (msg_len != 1) {
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
